        "kcal": 1040,
        "line": "🍽️ The bins are thin, and Adaeze looks it. You set your second half in front of Adaeze. 'Eat,' you say. Adaeze eats like someone making up for days."
      },
      {
        "day": 84,
        "vid": "adaeze_nwosu",
        "kcal": 1019,
        "line": "🍽️ The bins are thin, and Adaeze looks it. You set your second half in front of Adaeze. 'Eat,' you say. Adaeze eats like someone making up for days."
      },
      {
        "day": 87,
        "vid": "app_mgpsphkj976",
        "kcal": 1302,
        "line": "🍽️ Thin day. Your bowl stays half-full — the other half goes to Yamila, who's been quiet about being hungry."
      },
      {
        "day": 99,
        "vid": "fatima_hassan",
        "kcal": 402,
        "line": "🍽️ The bins are thin, and Fatima looks it. You set your second half in front of Fatima. 'Eat,' you say. Fatima eats like someone making up for days."
      },
      {
        "day": 100,
        "vid": "app_mgpsphgr8",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ Half your share tonight. You hand the rest to Alexander, who takes it with both hands and doesn't say a word until it's gone."
      },
      {
        "day": 101,
        "vid": "fatima_hassan",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ You wave off the second scoop and nod toward Fatima. 'Fatima eats first tonight.' Nobody at the fire disagrees."
      },
      {
        "day": 102,
        "vid": "fatima_hassan",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ Thin day. Your bowl stays half-full — the other half goes to Fatima, who's been quiet about being hungry."
      },
      {
        "day": 103,
        "vid": "app_mgpsphgr8",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ You push half your bowl across the fire to Alexander — 'eat. You need it more than I do.' Alexander doesn't argue. The bowl comes back scraped clean."
      }
    ]
